summary: 'After merging PR #49, found and fixed three Stop hook bugs (PR #54: nested .paradigm/.warpline state counted as source; no stop_hook_active loop guard causing infinite blocks). Founder chose to fix audit findings before shipping: PR #55 simple-git 4, zod 4, uuid removed, Aegis fixes (stage route option injection, browser UUID fallback, MCP SDK floor), logger added to build:core, and nevr.land registry commands + registry-client removed at founder request. PR #56 vitest 5 and tsup 9 / esbuild 0.28 declared once at root, root engines >=24.11; production and dev audits down to next/postcss in the unpublished site. All merged; founder publishing from the release checkout via checklist artifact.'
